<title>USA: Hudson Chartered sets dividends, stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Hudson Chartered sets dividends, stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>LAGRANGEVILLE, N.Y. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hudson Chartered Bancorp Inc said that on January 15 it will pay a 10 percent common stock dividend and $0.18 per share reqular quarterly cash dividend to shareholders of record on December 31.</p>
<p>The company also said it would buy back up to 200,000 of its common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The stock dividend is in addition to the regularly quarterly cash dividend, the company said.</p>
<p>The cash dividend will bring the company's cash payout for fiscal 1996 to $0.68 a share, the company said.</p>
</text>
